rcentage of the regular note size to use for notes with a cue and large","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"size as defined in the type element. The grace type is used for notes of cue size that that include a grace","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element. The cue type is used for all other notes with cue size, whether defined explicitly or implicitly via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a cue element. The large type is used for notes of large size. The text content represent the numeric","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"percentage. A value of 100 would be identical to the size of a regular note as defined by the music font.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"}}}